L$FINISH:
   Begin Case
   Case terminator$id = \"V0S12\"
      GoTo L$V0S12$FINISHED
   End Case
   If b$Abandoning Then GoTo L$ABORT
   If (seq$V0S6$status = 1) Then
      Call DSLogInfo(DSMakeMsg(\"DSTAGE_JSG_M_0072\\Note: Sequencer '%1' was entered, but never exited\", \"Wait1\"), \"@Coordinator\")
